# System Architecture

Project: Virexa AI Front Office

Version: 1.0 (MVP)

---

# Overview

Virexa AI Front Office is an AI-powered customer communication and lead management platform for real estate agencies.

The system receives customer inquiries, processes them using AI, searches company information, books appointments, stores customer data, and notifies human agents.

---

# High-Level Architecture

Customer

↓

Website Chat Interface

↓

Backend API

↓

AI Engine

↓

Knowledge Base + Property Database

↓

Lead Management System

↓

Agent Dashboard

↓

Notifications

---

# Main Components

## 1. Frontend

Purpose:
Provides interfaces for customers and agents.

Components:

- Customer chat widget
- Agent dashboard
- Admin dashboard
- Property management page

Technology:

- Next.js
- React
- Tailwind CSS

---

## 2. Backend

Purpose:
Handles business logic and communication between systems.

Responsibilities:

- Authentication
- API endpoints
- Lead management
- Property search
- Appointment booking
- Notifications

Technology:

- Python
- FastAPI

---

## 3. AI Engine

Purpose:
Understand customer requests and generate responses.

Responsibilities:

- Intent detection
- FAQ answering
- Lead qualification
- Conversation management
- Escalation

Technology:

- OpenAI API
- Prompt templates
- Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)

---

## 4. Knowledge Base

Purpose:
Provide verified information to the AI.

Contains:

- FAQs
- Office information
- Agent information
- Policies
- Buying guides
- Rental guides

Storage:

- Vector database
- Documents
- PDFs

---

## 5. Property Database

Stores:

- Properties
- Prices
- Availability
- Locations
- Agents
- Images

Technology:

- PostgreSQL

---

## 6. Lead Database

Stores:

- Name
- Phone
- Email
- Budget
- Property preference
- Timeline
- Lead score

Technology:

- PostgreSQL

---

## 7. Calendar System

Purpose:

Manage viewings.

Functions:

- Check availability
- Book appointments
- Reschedule appointments
- Send reminders

Future integrations:

- Google Calendar
- Outlook

---

## 8. Notifications

Send:

- New lead alerts
- Appointment alerts
- Customer requests

Channels:

- Email
- SMS
- WhatsApp (future)

---

## 9. Agent Dashboard

Agents can:

- View leads
- View appointments
- Review conversations
- Manage properties
- Follow up with customers

---

# Data Flow

Customer sends message

↓

Frontend sends request

↓

Backend receives request

↓

AI processes request

↓

AI searches knowledge base

↓

AI searches property database

↓

AI generates response

↓

Backend stores conversation

↓

Customer receives answer

↓

Lead information saved

↓

Agent notified

